绩效考核：数据驱动的极致效率追求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/luckin/level-and-compensation/performance-evaluation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"workplace-survival-guide","title":"瑞幸职场生存指南：高速扩张期的机会与压力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/luckin/level-and-compensation/workplace-survival-guide"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"role-career-paths","title":"职业发展路径 — 章节导读","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/luckin/role-career-paths","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engineering","title":"瑞幸技术岗位路径：从应用开发到系统架构的完整职业地图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/luckin/role-career-paths/engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"store-operations","title":"门店运营路径：从咖啡师到城市总监的实战攀升","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/luckin/role-career-paths/store-operations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"product-rd","title":"产品研发路径：从产品经理到爆品策划的创新方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/luckin/role-career-paths/product-rd"},{"seq":4,"slug":"marketing-growth","title":"市场增长路径：用户运营与品牌营销的规模化方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/luckin/role-career-paths/marketing-growth"},{"seq":5,"slug":"supply-chain","title":"供应链路径：从咖啡豆采购到冷链物流的全链路职业","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/luckin/role-career-paths/supply-chain"}]},{"seq":7,"slug":"ai-transformation","title":"AI 变革与智能化 — 章节导读","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/luckin/ai-transformation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-product-recommendation","title":"瑞幸咖啡 AI 产品推荐与个性化系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/luckin/ai-transformation/ai-product-recommendation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-store-operations","title":"瑞幸咖啡 AI 门店运营智能化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/luckin/ai-transformation/ai-store-operations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-workforce-impact","title":"瑞幸咖啡 AI 对岗位与就业的冲击","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/luckin/ai-transformation/ai-workforce-impact"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-practice-guide","title":"瑞幸咖啡员工 AI 实践指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/luckin/ai-transformation/ai-practice-guide"}]}]}